WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:06.650
It may be a faint dream, but let me see it
Hakanaki yume saredo yume misete

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:16.190
I'm in a complete daze under the sun
Konmei ryouran ni under the sun wow wow

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:20.920
Guided only by my flowering love for you
Konmei ryouran ni do ai do wow wow

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.530
Let the flower of life bloom
Hirakeyo inochi no hana

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:26.390
Let it follow its red hot desires
Akaku atsuku midasarete

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:28.550
This flame runs through the pulses
Fujouri na mirai no kodou

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.350
Of the absurd future
Kakenukeru honoo

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.450
I feel so guilty for devoting myself to earning your love
Aisaretakute kono mi sasageru tsumibukasa ga

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.530
I feel it tingling inside me
Watashi no naka de jirijiri shiteru ne

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.030
Desire
Yokubou

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.740
A bolt of lightning that brings about tomorrow
Sore wa ashita wo maneku inazuma

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:50.660
And turns into great pleasure
Yagate tsuyoi yorokobi ni naru

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:56.510
I'm sure you don't know yet
Mada shiranai hazu anata wa kitto

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:03.250
It's cruel when you can't even have a faint dream
Hakanaki yume saredo yume minu hibi wa mugoi yo

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:08.220
I want to hold on to these newborn desires
Umaretate no negai wo tada dakishimete itai

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:11.510
More wild than soft
Yasashii yori mo hageshiku ne

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:14.710
That will make my day
Sore de ima ga michite kuru sa

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:21.230
Who is going to protect this world (this dangerous world)
Michibikarete tashikameru sekai wa (ayaui sekai wa)

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:23.150
That I can only see for myself?
Dare ga mamoru

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:29.670
I can do it, so love me truly
Mamoreru dakara honki de ai shiteyo

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.530
You're not getting away this time!

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:37.080
Found you!

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.520
I caught something!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.120
Underwear again?

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:51.430
We're coming in, Juubei!

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:54.700
Yay! Let's all have a bath together!

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.600
Bath! Bath!

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.060
That's pretty refreshing, huh?!

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.740
You're so mean, Yuki!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:04.880
So? Was it there?

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:09.030
It was.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:15.160
Since the seal's still there, it must mean that Muneakira's General powers are still intact.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:20.390
Then Juubei couldn't transform because there was something about <i>her</i> that was off?

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:21.080
Can't say for sure.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:27.840
But what's certain is that unless she transforms, we've got no chance of defeating them.

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:34.970
There's no question that those four have powers equal to those of a Master Samurai.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:38.940
Yet the only Master Samurai we have on our side are you and me.

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:40.810
The numbers are in their favor.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.650
Just who the hell are they, anyway?

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.440
There's only one possible answer:

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:50.910
the very resurrection of Amakusa Shiro himself!

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:52.620
Yeah, not a chance.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:53.830
Oh, and why's that?

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:57.180
The Shogun <i>did</i> manage to pull off an overwhelming victory.

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:00.100
Even if Amakusa were to be revived,

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:02.180
the resurrection ceremony would require at least a hundred years.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:04.900
Try telling me sooner if you know that, you dog!

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:08.770
I was even considering different anti-Amakusa strategies!

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:11.560
Why would I even need to tell you about that?!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.910
Besides, it was top secret informatio-

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.220
Be quiet!

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:16.810
We're sorry.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.650
Good grief, you two.

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:21.700
You need to learn some manners.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:28.440
Even with all of those new security measures, we've still had more break-ins than before.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:30.640
It's not like it's a big loss or anything.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.150
All they stole was our underwear, after all.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.830
What I find strange is that even though they can sneak in easily,

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:39.450
they only seem to be targeting the underwear of a forehead midget.

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.440
And your point is?

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.170
They've sure got good taste for petty thieves.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:47.440
What? Did you seriously just compliment underwear thieves?

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:52.260
Anyone who goes after your underwear is clearly a lolicon!

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:55.000
If only that were true.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.510
H-How can you be so relaxed?

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:59.850
Do you have an idea who the culprit might be?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.100
In such a female-dominated dojo,

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:06.810
there's only one person who could possibly be lusting after my underwear!

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.190
N-No way!

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:17.240
Like I said, it couldn't be him.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:18.910
Can you really be so sure?

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.750
Wh-What do you mean?

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.200
Just think about it.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.170
Since when has our underwear been the target of thieves?

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:26.300
Oh!

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:29.380
That's right. Since Muneakira returned.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.150
B-But still...

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:35.980
Not to mention the total lack of female companionship during his journey.

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.390
And immediately upon his return to the dojo after so long,

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:45.060
he had no choice but to face our beautifully matured figures!

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.820
The male beast within him must've roared fiercely,

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:51.320
so he made a move on our underwear!

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:54.070
No, no, no, no! Not even a chance!

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.620
How can you be so sure?

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.360
Listen up.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:59.490
Even if Muneakira happened to be the culprit,

00:04:59.490 --> 00:05:01.330
I'd listen to whatever he had to say.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.870
I'd even perform a naked dance in front of everyone!

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:08.340
What's going on?

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:09.790
You're rarely this loud early in the morning.

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:13.220
I-It's nothing!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.720
<b>The Plan, Part One</b>

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.830
That damn Muneakira...

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.950
Soon he won't be satisfied with just the outside

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.560
and will start lusting for what's inside of us, too.

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:24.560
Listen closely, and be sure to remember this!

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:25.230
Yes!

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:31.110
Broaden his opportunities, and make sure our plan is a success!

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:32.610
<b>Princess Sen's Side</b>

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:40.030
Milady, aren't those Muneakira-sama's private-

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:42.660
I'm doing this to remove all doubt of Muneakira's innocence!

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:45.790
If he were the criminal, he'd possess some kind of incriminating evidence!

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:49.500
Just as I thought, there's nothi-

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.000
<b>The Plan, Part Two</b>

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:56.090
Nothing like collagen-rich food balls for good skin!

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:00.090
Once I eat this, even Muneakira won't be able to resist me!

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.680
Um, Yukimura-sama?

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.260
What is it?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.520
I'd like to finish doing the laundry while the sun's still up.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:10.440
That's fine. Go ahead, I'll be fine by myself.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:11.020
Okay!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:17.060
I'll be putting my secret drug recipe to use tonight.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.280
I know.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.810
That's right!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:22.780
I should wash my underwear for tonight as well!

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.040
<b>Princess Sen again</b>

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:34.600
M-Milady, I really don't think he'd hide anything here.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.630
What was that?

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:39.970
Use that to search the urinals!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.980
I can't afford to lose this challenge!

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:47.520
Yes, milady.

00:06:47.810 --> 00:06:49.020
<b>Yukimura again</b>

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.390
Washing clothes is so much fun!

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.320
Matabei!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.360
Please wash this pair of my special underwear.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:06:59.910
Sure thing.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.650
These need to be washed by hand.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.640
Okay?

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:03.660
Leave it to me.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:06.840
Now then.

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:09.580
Who's there?!

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:13.170
I know you're there!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.140
Was it just my imagination?

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.380
Yukimura-sama's underwear!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:25.020
What's the point of gathering so much fruit if we don't even have any customers?

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.790
Is someone there?

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:35.560
Of course not. There's no way anyone would come somewhere <i>this</i> isolated.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:38.580
What should I do with this fruit?

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.440
It'll be a miracle if it lasts until tomorrow.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.140
Just as I thought, someone's over there!

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.200
Show yourself!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.200
Huh?

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.050
Wh-What's that?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:51.660
Could it be...

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:54.490
an alien?!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:59.110
Those sounds... Are you a monkey?

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:03.800
You scared me there for a moment.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:07.160
You had me thinking, "First the Dark Samurai, and now an alien."

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:09.560
Wait!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.690
We've got some fruit left over.

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.060
Want to have a bite?

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.270
They were stolen again?

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.780
I'm terribly sorry.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.870
It must be someone on the inside.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.700
But it's definitely not Muneakira!

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.950
Then why don't we go find out who the real culprit is?

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.200
We're going after them, Matabei.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.010
Very well. If you'd be so kind...

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:36.490
What on Earth are you doing?

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:39.840
Matabei's sense of smell is better than most dogs.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:42.340
Now we'll be able to chase after the culprit as well.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:46.340
I'm really looking forward to finding out his true identity.

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:48.720
How is it? Is it good?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.820
Let's eat together again when we have leftovers.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.220
Would you like another?

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:01.230
Huh? I remember seeing that bag somewhere.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:04.320
Looks like the scent is leading us toward Muneakira.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.030
It's not! I'm certain of it!

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:07.930
I'm looking forward to it.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:08.620
To what?

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.920
To your naked dance, of course.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.640
The culprit's in here!

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.380
Let's go!

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:23.210
Huh? Isn't this some u-underw-

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.890
Found you!

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:25.720
Underwear thief!

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.340
So it was...

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.210
If you wanted them that badly, you could've just told me!

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:40.060
Muneakira!

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:41.910
Can you get any lower than this?!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:44.440
Y-You've got it wrong!
This is a misunderstanding!

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:46.570
No excuses!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.870
Blazing Flame!

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:03.000
So that's where you were hiding them!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.920
Milady, I'm looking forward to your naked dance.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:11.350
What's that thing?

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.300
That's...

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.360
Sasuke!

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.860
Isn't this Sasuke?

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:22.270
Sasuke.

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.490
<b>Ueda</b>

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.350
We're traveling toward Buou Academy,

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:34.740
currently under the control of our greatest enemy, the Tokugawas.

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:38.960
We can't bring you with us.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:42.170
Please understand, Sasuke. It's for your own good.

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:44.220
This is where we say farewell.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:46.340
Don't try to follow us.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.520
I told you not to follow us!

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:53.660
From this point on, I won't be able to ensure your safety.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:56.200
Don't you get it?

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.120
You'll just get in our way!

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:03.940
You must not follow us! Under any circumstances!

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.660
Sasuke!

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.070
Won't you listen to what I'm telling you?

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:11.640
Just go away!

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.490
I said such mean things to it.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.790
Its name is Sasuke.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.370
I kept it as my pet while I was in Ueda.

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:24.630
So it <i>was</i> a monkey!

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.210
Nice to meet you, Sacchin!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.690
Yeah!

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:30.470
Your name's Sasuke, so I'll call you Sacchin!

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:31.760
You don't like it?

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.800
So that means...

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:41.480
this monkey was the one who kept stealing Yukimura-san's underwear?

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.650
Because it couldn't let me know that it had returned,

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:48.440
it simply kept hiding and interacting with others to try and ease its loneliness.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.580
But still,

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:52.490
I'm impressed it was able to find you here.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.780
What's it saying, Yukimura?

00:11:56.780 --> 00:12:00.160
Who knows? I've never been able to understand it.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:01.540
Huh?

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.320
Aren't you its owner?

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.830
Do you seriously expect me to speak monkey?

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:08.920
It said, "A nice person talked to me."

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.350
Juubei, you can speak monkey?

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:14.180
Yeah, kinda.

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:20.620
It said, "Some crow told me the way."

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:35.700
What are you doing here?

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.450
I see. She's that way.

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.580
But you shouldn't go there.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.080
No, never mind.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:03.660
And it was all, "Caw-caw-caw wicky-wicky-wicky caw!"

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:04.720
Do you get it?

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:11.630
There's no point in speaking monkey if she can't even speak Japanese properly.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:12.820
My thoughts exactly.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.150
Death waits around the corner for everyone.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:21.830
He who is born is bound to die.

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:25.020
How much longer do you intend to babble on like that?

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.960
Was it really a good idea to give them an entire month?

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.840
Who knows?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:36.890
Musashi-han, don't you wonder why we were revived?

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:39.800
Oh, please.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.690
Where do you think you're going?

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.980
I hope you're not going to go meet her again!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.920
Wh-Why is there a monkey here?

00:13:56.930 --> 00:14:00.120
We already have a dog, so why not a monkey, too?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:01.700
A dog?

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:05.200
What's doggish about me?

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.960
You live in a doghouse, don't you?

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:09.820
She really is a dog.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:10.700
Yeah.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.690
A useless dog who can't even guard the house, at that.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:18.250
B-But more importantly, we need to talk about this Son Goku!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:21.070
It's not Son Goku. It's Sacchin!

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:23.580
Sasuke will be living with us from now on.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:28.690
I object to that! I couldn't be more against it!

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.470
There's no reason to have any pets in a maid cafe!

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.190
Sacchin's not just any pet!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:38.140
It really is a monkey against a dog.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.660
They truly can't get along.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:49.230
Whoa! So Gutsugutsu-san really <i>was</i> a dog!

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:51.860
Shuddup!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.030
Our dojo's dirt poor!

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.380
We don't have the money to keep a pet!

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:57.910
I see.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.940
In that case, we have no choice.

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:07.190
A certain stray dog keeps staying at the dojo,
but I guess we should chase it back to Yonezawa.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:11.470
Wh-Why does it have to come to that?

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:14.220
Monkey-san, are you gonna help me out?

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.110
Wh-What?

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:16.980
Dog

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:19.360
Dog
Wh-What are you doing?

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:23.160
That's amazing, Sacchin! You can write kanji!

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:27.600
Sasuke, make the pin in her hair say "dog" as well!

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:35.880
I'm! The! Number! Woof! Maid! In! This! Cafe!

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:39.990
Wow! So you're number woof!

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:42.920
Yeah! I'm number woof! Woof!

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:44.290
Woof, woof!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:48.470
This dog is absolutely essential for this maid cafe to function!

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:49.390
Dog?

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.440
No, I meant human!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:56.120
Unlike this monkey who can't even work as a maid!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:59.110
Oh look, a customer!

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:01.900
If you're really number woof,
then show us what you can do!

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:05.200
Okay, leave it to me!

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.080
Just you watch, monkey!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:12.960
I'll show you woof's better here!

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:20.930
Welcome, milady!

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:21.800
Geez...

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:25.010
At least put on some panties. You're gonna catch a cold.

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.600
Hey, milady!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:33.100
I'm back, Fake!

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:37.110
I'm the real Juubei, you know!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:38.610
<b>Five hours later</b>

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:39.730
Closed for today

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:41.360
Only one guest today, too.
Closed for today

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:46.320
I hate to admit it, but Kanetsugu had a point.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:52.120
If we add Sasuke's food to this...

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:58.420
What should I do now?

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:00.800
<b>One hour later</b>

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.520
Onii-chan, hurry up!

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:16.560
Huh, Sacchin?

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:20.940
What are you doing out so late?

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:24.420
Let's head back in.

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.160
Huh?

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.570
What's the matter, Juubei?

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.620
Look, it's Sacchin!

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.730
All that luggage!

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:36.120
Do you want to return to Ueda?

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.200
Is that it, Sacchin?

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:42.700
That's not true.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.020
What's it saying?

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:49.470
It says that if it stayed here, it'd just be causing trouble for all of us.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.930
Did something happen, Sasuke?

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.230
Are you really okay with leaving Yuki again?

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:00.890
What's wrong, Sacchin?

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.110
Please don't cry!

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:04.990
What's all the ruckus so late at night?

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:07.850
I'll turn you all in for disturbing the peace!

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:09.850
Terrible news, Gutsugutsu-san!

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.910
Sacchin wants to go back to Ueda!

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:20.460
So you're trying to escape before we could settle our argument?!

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.490
I won't let you have your way!

00:18:22.490 --> 00:18:24.210
Hold on, Kanetsugu!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.590
Wild animals should stay out of this!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:30.680
I won't let you go until we've settled everything!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:38.380
Gutsugutsu-san, don't be mean to Sacchin!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:42.650
How could I ever let you go after you shamed me like that?!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:46.840
You're staying at the Yagyuu Dojo!

00:18:48.070 --> 00:18:49.910
Sacchin!

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:19.020
Wh-What's going on?!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.810
What's happening?

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:38.660
What?

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.210
So Sasuke was a human?

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.040
No, it's definitely a monkey.

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:51.850
These numbers are the same level as a Master Samurai!

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:54.390
So it looks like Muneakira's powers are working just fine!

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:56.330
That's amazing, Sacchin!

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:59.640
N-No way! The monkey crossed with the beast!

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.740
I'm glad you're not hurt.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:11.870
So the General's powers work on monkeys, too.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:14.160
<b>The next day</b>

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:18.670
Thanks to Sasuke, we've got a full house today.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:21.370
Now we can cut our losses a bit.

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:22.580
So cute!

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:28.290
On that note, I never realized there were so many students at this academy.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.520
There are a lot more than usual
because it's convenient for the plot.

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:31.950
Got a problem with that?

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:32.970
N-Not at all.

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:42.620
So it turns back into a monkey whenever it's tired?

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:45.560
It needs to preserve its strength.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.480
Just rest for now, Sacchin.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:50.650
So cute!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.150
They appreciate its charming looks.

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:57.590
It's certainly more useful than the dog.

00:20:57.590 --> 00:21:00.630
That reminds me. Where's Kanetsugu?

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:02.790
This is a serious problem!

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:06.040
If even the monkey can become a Master Samurai,

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:09.800
then I'll be the number woof candidate to be killed off from the show!

00:21:12.460 --> 00:21:15.210
I won't let things turn out that way!

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:19.390
No matter what it takes, I'm going to be staying right here!

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:21.720
You never do any work at all!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:24.890
Why don't you just go back to Yonezawa?!

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.740
Episode Two

00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:18.710
I didn't choose "love" as my trademark just for show.

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:23.070
I'm determined to love every living moment and every dying moment as well!

00:23:23.070 --> 00:23:27.870
Then I'm sure the subs will show "love" when you die.

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:28.690
Of course.

00:23:28.690 --> 00:23:30.650
That's obviously the case.

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.980
Next time: Love and Kiss!

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:37.670
Oh my, Kanetsugu, I think you just set your own death flag.

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:39.320
Huh? Seriously?
